note SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-only
note otmsg: glue from the translator to the contract lane's codec and
note validator (native/omegese45/vocab.om and msg.om, concatenated before
note this file). The translator never re-implements the R45 grammar: every
note G and P line is validated by ocsetgl / ocvline.

note Copy otin[o, o+n) into the contract input buffer ocin. False when the
note line does not fit.
fn otcopy o ulong n ulong to bool
if gt n len ocin
ret false
end
for i ulong n
put ocin i get otin add o i
end
ret true
end

note Append the contract reason word for -v (v < 0 from ocvline/ocsetgl).
fn otprs v long to void
r = ulong neg v
if or lt r 1 gt r 20
otpdec r
ret
end
o = mul sub r 1 8
for j ulong 8
c = get ocrtx add o j
if ne c 32
otpb c
end
end
end

note Append the surface word of vocabulary id.
fn otpword id ulong to void
ocvinit
o = get ocwo id
for j ulong get ocwl id
otpb get ocvtsv add o j
end
end
